  "label": "Cultural Sensitivity Around Pig Trading",
  "description": "In some cultures, pigs may hold religious or symbolic significance, and their trading may be viewed differently than in others. Understanding this requires knowledge of cultural norms and religious practices in different regions. This background knowledge is relevant to interpreting the potential sensitivity or cultural context of the activity shown, which may be misinterpreted without this knowledge.",
